These icons (export_envelope, camera_orbit, camera_wayside, camera_cab, settings, check_on, check_off) are original line artwork
drawn for COYPU Builder on a 24 px grid with a 2 px stroke. They are not taken from any third-party icon
set, and they are released under the same MIT licence as the rest of the repository (see the LICENSE file at
the repository root for the full text).
